iqran-setoran-model

This repository redistributes a converted and quantized copy of
"whisper-base-ar-quran" by Tarteel AI
(https://huggingface.co/tarteel-ai/whisper-base-ar-quran),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

That model is a fine-tune of "whisper-base" by OpenAI
(https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-base), released under the MIT License.

Modifications: converted from Hugging Face format to ggml using whisper.cpp's
convert-h5-to-ggml.py (with n_text_ctx taken from max_target_positions), and
quantized to q5_0. No retraining was performed.
